## Additional Notes

### Educational Use
This project was created as part of an educational group project to demonstrate
mastery of HTML5, CSS3, web semantics, accessibility, and responsive design
principles. While the code is original and independently written, the design
inspiration draws from modern luxury restaurant websites and Material Design
principles.

### Attribution
If you use this code for learning purposes, please provide attribution by
linking back to this repository.

### Design Credits
- Typography: Google Fonts (Playfair Display, Plus Jakarta Sans)
- Color System: Custom luxury restaurant palette based on Material Design 3
- Icons: Unicode emoji characters for cross-platform compatibility
- Layout: Original CSS Grid and Flexbox implementation

### Browser Support
This project supports all modern browsers with CSS Grid and Flexbox support:
- Chrome 57+
- Firefox 52+
- Safari 10.1+
- Edge 16+

### Accessibility Compliance
This code follows WCAG 2.1 AA guidelines and has been tested for:
- Keyboard navigation
- Screen reader compatibility
- High contrast mode support
- Reduced motion preferences
- Semantic HTML structure